@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam roundcorner 8

title Fig 4.6 Sequence Diagram — CodeSense Review & Exploration Workflow

participant "Developer" as Dev
participant "Presentation\n(React 19 SPA)" as Web
participant "API Gateway\n(Node.js)" as Gateway
participant "Review Engine\n(Python 3.11)" as Engine
participant "Data & AI\n(Mongo, Chroma, Gemini)" as Backend

Dev -> Web : submit repository (URL / local path)
Web -> Gateway : POST /api/review (JWT token)
Gateway -> Engine : spawn review job (jobId)
Engine -> Engine : clone sandbox & static heuristic scan
Engine -> Backend : 4-stage sequential LLM prompts (P1-P4)
Backend --> Engine : return review sections & health scorecard
Engine -> Backend : persist 12-section markdown & index ChromaDB
Engine -> Gateway : notify job complete
Web -> Gateway : poll status & fetch specification
Gateway --> Web : return review report & health scores
Web --> Dev : render dashboard, Mermaid charts & RAG chat
Dev -> Web : query code assistant (natural language)
Web -> Backend : retrieve top-K context & stream response
Backend --> Dev : source-cited interactive explanation

@enduml
